{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，<strong>韓國LEET法學研究生入學考試滿分考生李振宇（32歲），在深陷AI作弊質疑風波後，於首爾一家汽車旅館被發現心臟驟停，經確認已經身亡</strong>。李鎮宇此前在韓國法學專業研究生入學考試拿到滿分，一度成為網絡熱議的學霸。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587102.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:53:46.472220+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:44:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:47:06.085431+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:47:06.085431+00:00","content_hash":"a37d14d3de4ca2153774d18554d296f9881a21bd989a4e3f74d73bb199fd6914","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}